{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "027yuk_402_2_4_027_02_09_a",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:8558e78171cb325bdfc8e63eac3780678da98795cc4b95b5cffbe8435535f11f",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:027yuk_402_2_4_027_02_09_a:2_4_027_02_09_a:cmd-000006:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1010670742473bda64079aeda31316a214ffc11603d2b03cdaa65072c328664e",
      "text": "辛苦了，制作人。\n现在方便吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:027yuk_402_2_4_027_02_09_a:2_4_027_02_09_a:cmd-000008:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:27767477eea1b4a547794b6a87b89885a94f579f8e44113d14bcb83d5c5d2908",
      "text": "其实我把这次工作的事\n跟Cafe Parade的成员们提了提，",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:027yuk_402_2_4_027_02_09_a:2_4_027_02_09_a:cmd-000010:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4ac202ff9d5cf56fded481c21ec6e1702cc037a0006e2205d7ce4e6f180d90f3",
      "text": "阿斯兰和东云就设计了Cafe Parade风格的\n“天空婚礼”全套宴席菜单呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:027yuk_402_2_4_027_02_09_a:2_4_027_02_09_a:cmd-000012:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:53f5c2694d3acaa801acd4a5175dd1324d882bca7dd8265b6a42f499249e384e",
      "text": "大家就说，一定要做给制作人尝尝。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:027yuk_402_2_4_027_02_09_a:2_4_027_02_09_a:cmd-000014:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3514021ff217717df768d5f77d7186663adf6dc4bdf1939739472e3f096b1f60",
      "text": "虽然有点突然，下一个休息日的晚上，\n你还有空吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:027yuk_402_2_4_027_02_09_a:2_4_027_02_09_a:cmd-000016:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4c0eaba8e078e717c9567b26647a710ef971e0db65fc7d05c70fc30c00a58aeb",
      "text": "那天大家不是\n也休息吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:027yuk_402_2_4_027_02_09_a:2_4_027_02_09_a:cmd-000017:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:bc3b1fe8060ae657ff870435d3340413f7b5bf3866c7c6e03723882c2ea915e7",
      "text": "真的可以\n这样吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:027yuk_402_2_4_027_02_09_a:2_4_027_02_09_a:cmd-000020:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4b2a52cefc3bc09d8b05b558d9bd754cae6fb3a9868b4f85ed2927f84c0eb4b6",
      "text": "要是为了制作人，\n大家都很乐意聚在一起的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:027yuk_402_2_4_027_02_09_a:2_4_027_02_09_a:cmd-000025:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:bb7af59737e814c5efba5d444d2d532a741d0464049f9c695dd97e541f8c365d",
      "text": "当然可以啦。一直承蒙制作人的关照，\n请务必让我们招待你一次。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:027yuk_402_2_4_027_02_09_a:2_4_027_02_09_a:cmd-000029:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:76507c4c3f2899c7d4c30fcceac944a9e7588c9bfc41f79dcb0a9ab6ae5470ad",
      "text": "那么，下个休息日就请来Cafe Parade\n度过一段美妙时光吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:027yuk_402_2_4_027_02_09_a:2_4_027_02_09_a:cmd-000031:choice_short:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9dd0f7743506f936c2033459fbf7c3ba54e52edaa3a3b30381a491c3f173e160",
      "text": "非常感谢，\n我很乐意",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:027yuk_402_2_4_027_02_09_a:2_4_027_02_09_a:cmd-000034:phone_message:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d73cb9d01a7be8678655b25857f4cddd7347db546179189a47df6e923108d67c",
      "text": "敬请期待吧。\n大家会为你献上最棒的款待的。",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
